  <PopupAnnouncement id="7" name="LiveRoulette" startdate="11/04/2013" enddate="12/05/2013" effectdate="05/11/2013" width="450" height="220" top="110" left="350">
    <en-US src="">
      We are happy to announce that we are going to launch the new Live Roulette under our VIP casino Regal Casino" on <font color='red'><strong>{effectdate} 12PM (GMT+8)</strong></font>. 
      Higher betting limit will be offered in this product, kindly check your Live Casino setting. 
      You may now start to do the setting for your downlines or check with your upline. 
      <br />Thanks!
    </en-US>
    <zh-CN src="">
      VIP 皇玺娱乐厅将在<font color='red'>
